{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
COMING SOON PILL / BACK IN STOCK ALERT TRIGGER
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Shown when every variant of a product is sold out. With a product it is a "Tell me when back" button: it opens the
sheet that asks for an email (snippets/back-in-stock.liquid, behaviour in assets/back-in-stock.js), or signs the visitor
up straight away if we already have their email, and then reads "We'll email you". Without a product it is a plain pill.

Wrap the call in its own row on cards so the card layout can order it above the price row:

{% unless product.available %}<div class="coming-soon-row">{% render 'coming-soon-pill', product: product %}</div>{% endunless %}

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* product: the sold-out product. Its variant IDs are passed to the sheet so one sign-up covers every colour.
* layout: "pill" (default, for cards) or "pdp" (a full-width button under the sold-out button on the product page)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if product != blank -%}
  {%- assign alert_default_label = 'back_in_stock.pill' | t -%}
  {%- if layout == 'pdp' -%}
    {%- assign alert_default_label = 'back_in_stock.pdp_button' | t -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- assign alert_saveable = false -%}
  {%- if product.type == 'Audiobooks' or product.type == 'Audiobooks Bundle' -%}
    {%- assign alert_saveable = true -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  <button type="button" class="coming-soon-pill coming-soon-pill--action{% if layout == 'pdp' %} coming-soon-pill--pdp{% endif %}" data-bis-trigger aria-pressed="false" data-product-id="{{ product.id }}" data-product-title="{{ product.title | escape }}" data-variants="{{ product.variants | map: 'id' | join: ',' }}" data-saveable="{{ alert_saveable }}"{% if product.featured_media %} data-image="{{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 160 }}"{% endif %} data-label="{{ alert_default_label }}" data-label-set="{{ 'back_in_stock.pill_set' | t }}">
    <svg class="coming-soon-pill__bell" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9"/><path d="M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0"/></svg>
    <svg class="coming-soon-pill__tick" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>
    <span data-bis-label>{{ alert_default_label }}</span>
  </button>
{%- else -%}
  <span class="coming-soon-pill">{{- 'product.general.more_coming_soon' | t -}}</span>
{%- endif -%}
